# crack_baseline_v3 (2026-09-30) = R7 (25 degC) / R7a (45 degC). CURRENT BASELINE.
# crack_baseline_v2 + isolation lithium trapping (theta = 1, CHANGES.md item 13)
# + graphite redirect yield re-raised to restore Gr LAM. ONE shared set; runs on
# the high_temp_45C fork. Per temperature, only these differ (set by
# rpt_soc_plots.py's CONFIGS):
#   25 degC: C64_T_AMBIENT_K=298.15  C64_F0=0.7  C64_WIDTH=5e-3
#   45 degC: C64_T_AMBIENT_K=318.15  C64_F0=0.8  C64_WIDTH=3e-4
# Fitted with RPTs aligned to the real RPT EFCs (rpt_soc_plots.py 25|45 --aligned).
# All *_EAC / SI_ESEI Arrhenius factors are exactly 1 at 298.15 K.
C64_SI_CRACK_MULT=1.0e3
C64_SI_CRACK_EAC=90000
C64_SI_ESEI=35000
C64_SI_TAU_LAM_ISO=3.5e8
C64_SI_LAM_ISO_EXPONENT=20
C64_SI_REDIRECT_LAM_YIELD=0.25
C64_SI_YIELD_EAC=35000
C64_SI_ISO_LI_TRAP=1.0
C64_GR_REDIRECT_TO_LAM=1
C64_GR_REDIRECT_LAM_YIELD=0.025
C64_GR_YIELD_EAC=56500
C64_GR_LAM_ISO_EXPONENT=10
C64_SI_STRESS_LAM_DAMP_EXP=0.25
C64_MAX_CYCLES=1800
